Third-party components
======================

Vendored in this repository
---------------------------

PLAAC   MIT (Whitehead Institute, BBRI, UMass)
        License text: tools/PLAAC/plaac-master/LICENSE.TXT
        Usage and provenance: tools/PLAAC/README.md

PScore  CC-BY-4.0 (Vernon et al., eLife 2018)
        Attribution is required by the licence. Source and terms:
        tools/PScore/README.md. The PScore DBS data is not redistributed;
        tools/PScore/install.sh fetches it.

SEG     NCBI public-domain convention
        tools/SEG/README.md

